<tr id="row_113_46_" class="even" style="display:none;"><td class="entry"><span style="width:16px;display:inline-block;">&#160;</span><span id="arr_113_46_" class="arrow" onclick="dynsection.toggleFolder('113_46_')"><span class="arrowhead closed"></span></span><span class="icona"><span class="icon">C</span></span><a class="el" href="class_tool_component.html" target="_self">ToolComponent</a></td><td class="desc">Clase base para todos los componentes de herramientas. Se activa/desactiva automáticamente con OnEnable/OnDisable del GameObject </td></tr>
